  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個由 Serilum 開發的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>《快速右鍵》是一款改善生活品質（QoL）模組，讓玩家無需放置即可快速使用多種功能性方塊。只需在空中點擊右鍵即可使用。可以快速在床上睡覺、存取終界箱或開啟潛影盒。部分方塊會直接開啟，其他則會自動放置。請參考下方的範例 GIF 以更清楚了解其運作方式。<br><br>支援的方塊：<br>床、製圖台、合成台、終界箱、研磨台、潛影盒、鍛造台與切石機。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableQuickBeds</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用床的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickCartographyTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用製圖台的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickCraftingTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用合成台的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickEnderChests</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用終界箱的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickGrindstones</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用研磨台的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickShulkerBoxes</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用潛影盒的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickSmithingTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用鍛造台的快速功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickStonecutters</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>若要在空中點擊右鍵啟用切石機的快速功能。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>快速在床上睡覺。睡覺結束後會自動放置並收回。</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>快速存取您的終界箱，無需依賴絲綢之觸即可自動收回。</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>快速開啟潛影盒，存取其中的物品後繼續前進。</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>快速製作物品，再也不用走到哪都擺滿合成台了。</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>同樣適用於製圖台與其他村民職業方塊。</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載檔仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您即可自由在任何整合包中使用本模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
